  "details": "For people not using a Headset, needing Firstperson to always be active is unusual. By adding a key to activate Thirdperson, it would allow low-performance avatars with poor viewpoints to become more usable, done by simply forcing the viewpoint 1 meters behind the Avatar, at a simple keypress. It's either that, or live viewpoint editing.",
